                <pb facs="0833" n="739" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg739"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr. Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Spain</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-09-04"><hi rendition="#italic">September 4,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Understood here <hi rendition="#italic">Competitor</hi> case already decided
                    annulling judgment and ordering new trial before ordinary tribunal. Decision
                    expected shortly.</p>
            </div>
